==Matches==
The match schedule was confirmed on 9 September 2025.<ref name="Dates"/><ref>{{cite web |url=https://digitalhub.fifa.com/m/18d32b5e71e584f0/original/FIFA-Intercontinental-Cup-Qatar-2025-Match-Schedule.pdf |title=Match Schedule FIFA Intercontinental Cup Qatar 2025 |website=FIFA.com |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association |access-date=10 December 2025}}</ref> If a match was tied after normal playing time, 30 minutes of [[Overtime (sports)#Association football|extra time]] were played. If still tied after extra time, a [[penalty shoot-out (association football)|penalty shoot-out]] was held to determine the winner.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://digitalhub.fifa.com/m/41ca9a261eb3f7d8/original/FIC2025_regulations_EN.pdf |title=Regulations for the FIFA Intercontinental Cup Qatar 2025 |website=FIFA.com |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association |access-date=10 December 2025}}</ref>

