==Trophies awarded==
Multiple trophies were awarded to winning teams in the competition. In addition to an updated trophy given to the winners of the Intercontinental Cup [[2025 FIFA Intercontinental Cup final|final]], trophies were awarded to the winning teams of the African–Asian–Pacific Cup (contested by the AFC, CAF and OFC representatives), Derby of the Americas (contested by the CONCACAF and CONMEBOL representatives) and Challenger Cup (contested by the winners of the two aforementioned matches). These trophies were similar to each other, but with different coloured globes.<ref name="key info"/>
* '''Intercontinental Cup:''' {{fbaicon|FRA}} [[Paris Saint-Germain FC|Paris Saint-Germain]]
* '''Challenger Cup:''' {{fbaicon|BRA}} [[CR Flamengo|Flamengo]]
* '''Derby of the Americas:''' {{fbaicon|BRA}} [[CR Flamengo|Flamengo]]
* '''African–Asian–Pacific Cup:''' {{fbaicon|EGY}} [[Pyramids FC|Pyramids]]

